sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant D as UserDashboardScene<br/>DashboardFlowController
  participant P as ProductRepository<br/>+ CatalogSync
  participant F as Firestore products / brands
  participant R as ProductRecommender
  participant E as ProductAnalysisEngine
  participant C as UserProfileRepository
  D->>C: profile (cloud or phone copy)
  D->>P: products the app may use
  alt checked less than 10 min ago
    P-->>D: phone copy (0 reads)
  else
    P->>F: entries changed since newest stamp + count
    F-->>P: changes (full download once a day)
    P-->>D: updated list
  end
  D->>R: For(profile, products, maximum)
  loop each product
    R->>E: Analyse(ingredients, profile)
    E-->>R: status, findings
  end
  R-->>D: picks (order of the catalogue list)
  Note over D,R: Nothing about the user leaves the phone
